# Uploaded documents (electronic signatures, endorsement letters, Special Orders,
# technology maps, line-item budgets, reporting-stage documents).
#
# These are runtime user data, not source: they belong in the configured storage root
# (rpis.storage.upload-dir / RPIS_UPLOAD_DIR), which for a deployment is an absolute
# path outside the repository - for example C:\rpis-data\uploads. They were previously
# committed, which put genuine signatures and letters in version control.
#
# Ignoring the directories does not remove the copies already in history; see
# backend/DEPLOYMENT.md for the options.
uploads/
backend/uploads/
